{"id":"vod_md_4082","vodId":"4082","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"飞翔的魔女","name_cn":"飞翔的魔女","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"12集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230903-1/83f45b357eb89ecbfce912390be62762.jpg"},"summary":"木幡真琴（篠田南 配音）是一名见习魔女，同时亦是一名十五岁的高中一年级女生。魔女界有一个约定俗成的规矩，那就是在十五岁成人礼之后，魔女们便要走上社会开始独自生活，进行魔女的修行。如此，真琴孤身一人来到了青森县，居住在堂兄仓本圭（菅原慎介 配音）家中，转入了这里的高中，开始了崭新的生活。在这里，真琴结识了许多善良的朋友们，天真可爱对魔女稍稍有些害怕的仓木千夏（铃木绘里 配音）、家中经营着酒铺的石渡直（三上枝织 配音）、误食了魔法药而在白天会变成狗面的犬养（日野麻里 配音）、和母亲与幽灵雏（金元寿子 配音）一起经营咖啡店的椎名杏子（井口裕香 配音）。在这些朋友们的陪伴下，有笑有泪的剧目拉开了序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-03 08:56:20","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/ZiZ0MMrv/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/dfsHQCsj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/ztyRKDFH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/4rvyNaj2/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/k2mh7E65/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/gQLhLKhU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/i01IEBNJ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/GqCpkg1p/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/dHgpPGV6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/iN3qg9aB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/4fCi8ZwB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230902/ycXP6DVN/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:32:49.498Z"}